@props(title:text)
<article class="studio wrap"><span class="eyebrow">THE STUDIO</span><h1>A small studio.<br><em>A long view.</em></h1><div class="studio-body"><p class="lead">We bring calm thinking and a hands-on approach to the spaces you call your own.</p><div><h2>Built around people</h2><p>Every project begins with a conversation, not a drawing. How do you spend your mornings? Where does the light fall? What would make an ordinary day a little better?</p><p>We work from those details outward, using natural materials and clear ideas to create places that will grow with you.</p></div></div><div class="studio-projects"><section id="courtyard"><img src="/courtyard.svg" alt="Courtyard House illustration" width="720" height="680"><h2>Courtyard House</h2><p>A home turned inward toward a quiet garden. Deep window reveals, limewashed walls, and a generous threshold connect every room to the outdoors.</p></section><section id="hillside"><img src="/hillside.svg" alt="Hillside Retreat illustration" width="720" height="680"><h2>Hillside Retreat</h2><p>A compact timber house follows the shape of its landscape. A single broad roof creates a sheltered edge for watching the weather pass.</p></section></div><section id="contact" class="contact"><span class="eyebrow">SAY HELLO</span><h2>Good things start<br>with a conversation.</h2><a href="mailto:hello@forma.example">hello@forma.example ↗</a><p>Forma is a fictional studio built to demonstrate NeoKit. See the example README to make it your own.</p></section></article>
